ive.org/web/20150410200405/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/fathom-edict-2013-01-03#:~:text=We%20are%20the%20Simic.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Fathom Edict","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2013-01-03","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/fathom-edict-2013-01-03","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150410200405/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/fathom-edict-2013-01-03#:~:text=We%20are%20the%20Simic.%22","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150410200405/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/fathom-edict-2013-01-03","license":null,"text":"\"The Fathom Edict\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jan 2013. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"zurbit-e0","era":{"date":"2018-04-27","era":"dom","label":"Dominaria"},"summary":"Zurbit discovers Relno's tower ransacked by merfolk.","participants":["zurbit","relno","merfolk"],"location":null,"importance":"minor","page":"wiki/zurbit","order":3368,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":1,"quote":"The bookshelves in Relno 's tower were bare, papers were everywhere, flasks and beakers lay broken","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Zurbit#:~:text=The%20bookshelves%20in%20Relno,and%20beakers%20lay%20broken","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Zurbit","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Zurbit","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Zurbit#:~:text=The%20bookshelves%20in%20Relno,and%20beakers%20lay%20broken","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Zurbit\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"zurbit-e1","era":{"date":"2018-04-27","era":"dom","label":"Dominaria"},"summary":"Zurbit rows Pip out to the merf